      "details": "\r\n<p>Brikinniai? is listed as \"Monte San Basilio\" in the <em>BTCGI</em>. The two places are also associated in the <em>Barrington Atlas</em> (but not in Manni 1981). The modern place is also often called \"Monte Casale di San Basilio\" or even simply \"Casale\".</p>\r\n",
